<p>On bigger projects I work as part of a team: with CROMO for video, with BIAS for audio post-production and music.</p>

<h2>Production companies</h2>

<div class="griglia-schede">
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="cromo">
<h3>CROMO</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://cromostudio.it/" rel="noopener">cromostudio.it</a></p>
<p>Video production company led by my brother Edoardo: cinematic storytelling for branded content and documentaries. We have worked together since 2015, he does the picture, I do the sound.</p>
<p><strong>Together:</strong> <a href="/en/projects/maserati-mc20/">Maserati MC20</a>, <a href="/en/projects/jw-anderson-diadora-equipe/">JW Anderson x Diadora</a>, <a href="/en/projects/diadora-run-valley/">Diadora Run Valley</a>, <a href="/en/projects/the-missing-head/">The Missing Head</a>, <a href="/en/projects/cda-50-il-viaggio/">CDA 50 years</a>, <a href="/en/projects/fitt-industrial/">FITT Industrial</a>, <a href="/en/projects/weldan/">Weldan</a>, <a href="/en/projects/pitars/">Pitars</a>.</p>
</div>
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="invrsion">
<h3>Invrsion</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://invrsion.com/" rel="noopener">invrsion.com</a></p>
<p>3D animation and immersive reality studio.</p>
<p><strong>Together:</strong> <a href="/en/projects/arcadia-earth/">A Vision For Tomorrow</a> for Arcadia Earth, a 360° film screened in planetariums in the USA and China. They did the animation, I did the sound design and the 5.1 and 7.1 mix.</p>
</div>
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="method">
<h3>Method</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://www.methodcinema.it/" rel="noopener">methodcinema.it</a></p>
<p>Film production company making documentaries and feature films. With Method I work on the sound of their documentaries.</p>
</div>
</div>

<h2>Agencies and creative studios</h2>

<div class="griglia-schede">
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="pm2">
<h3>PM2</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://www.pm2.com/" rel="noopener">pm2.com</a></p>
<p>Strategy, content and creative agency. For PM2 I handle the sound from location recording to the final mix.</p>
<p><strong>Together:</strong> Real People, a series of documentary portraits for CMP, technical mountain clothing, shot where the protagonists live (<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nl8XKkbmf6s" rel="noopener">the campaign video</a>); <a href="/en/projects/cda-50-il-viaggio/">CDA 50 years, the journey</a>; and many corporate stories, including Carinzia, Connubia and Calligaris.</p>
</div>
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="bias">
<h3>BIAS</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://www.bias.space/" rel="noopener">bias.space</a></p>
<p>Sound design and audio post-production studio, which also signs lighting design for theatre and exhibitions. With BIAS I work on audio post-production and music composition.</p>
<p><strong>Together:</strong> the documentary Tintoretto: The Artist Who Killed Painting by Erminio Perocco, where I did the dialogue editing, and the feature film <a href="/en/projects/sottopelle/">Subdermal (Sottopelle)</a>, mixed by BIAS.</p>
</div>
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="d-and-co">
<h3>D&amp;Co</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://dandco.it/" rel="noopener">dandco.it</a></p>
<p>Strategic marketing, branding and integrated communication agency.</p>
<p><strong>Together:</strong> <a href="/en/projects/pitars/">Pitars, Simply extraordinary</a>, with sound design, original music and mix, and Savio, a client we have followed for years.</p>
</div>
<div class="scheda-box scheda-partner" id="studio-creta">
<h3>Studio Creta</h3>
<p class="partner-dove"><a href="https://studiocreta.net/" rel="noopener">studiocreta.net</a></p>
<p>Graphic design and visual communication studio. Together we work for Confindustria Alto Adriatico: I take care of the audio in their videos.</p>
</div>
</div>

